        "content": "// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\npragma solidity 0.8.37;\n\n// Dispatch with only a nonpayable fallback: it runs on any calldata, empty\n// included, and reverts on value.\ncontract FallbackOnly {\n    uint256 private calls;\n\n    fallback() external {\n        calls += 1;\n    }\n}\n"
